// EntryString :
"P3793695339" "Your helicopter ride is interrupted by a loud explosion!<br><br>The helicopter crashes into the street of Independence Port, but you manage to escape relatively unharmed.<br><br>Up ahead, you see the cause of the crash - the Freakshow!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P396653017" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>This is Penelope  Yin! Are you all okay?! I'm doing everything I can to track down what's happening!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3624285735" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Okay... so it looks like a big shot Freakshow named Clamor was just recently broken out of the Zig...<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>She was one of the really smart Freakshow, it wouldn't surprise me if she was behind all of this!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P432151044" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>The PPD Chief for Independence Port is being held hostage in the station, {TaskForceName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2688086736" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CadetBlue>Hello?! {TaskForceName}? This is Robert Alderman, one of the city council. We've been kidnapped by the Freakshow!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CadetBlue>The batteries on this communicator are about to go, but I'm sending where I think we're located to Penelope Yin. Please, you have to save us!"
