"P2393553099" "Oh man, this is <i>really</i> bad! Clamor of the Freakshow is out, and the city council has been kidnapped by those... well, those <i>freaks</i>!<br><br>Lucky for us that Robert Alderman sent us that location! We need to move fast, {TaskForceName}, the Freakshow aren't known for keeping their hostages alive!"

