"P1641484068" "I'd love to give you some long briefing here, {TaskForceName}, but to be honest, I've got nothing. We can end this right here, though, if we go rescue the city council from the Freakshow!<br><br>The location that Mr. Alderman gave me leads to an office building right nearby!<br><br>If you hurry, we can rescue all of them and be on our way!"
// AcceptString :
"P3461401376" "We're on it."
// SendOffString :
"P4043785135" "Great! I'm going to work on tracking down Clamor. Her mind is hard to read... there's just a <i>ton</i> of chaotic thoughts going around Independence Port right now that I can't pinpoint <i>which</i> one is hers. Maybe you'll luck out and she'll be there with the hostages!"
