// Script Variable SaysList :
"P741367963" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Oh no... I didn't check to see who ELSE was in there with Alderman! I'm so sorry, {TaskForceName}!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>It looks like it's... the Council! Wait, that makes sense! ... Why does that make sense... OH!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Clamor, she used to WORK with the Council... or maybe it was with the 5th Column. I don't know, those two groups are just confusing to understand.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>It looks like the Council are after her... we need to find out why!"
